	(text "EMG CHANNEL - bipolar input, both legs identical (P = electrode pin 1 / IN+, N = electrode pin 2 / IN-)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "070e2803-aee1-5dff-ac12-b4ba01e92320")
	)
	(text "Netclasses for RB-02: ELEC_x = EMG_ELECTRODE, HIZ_x = EMG_HIZ (F.Cu only, no vias, guard), BUF_x/ACN_x/AIN_x = EMG_BUF.\nProbe policy: no test pads on HIZ_x or AIN_x - probe at existing resistor/capacitor pads."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "25d7b40b-f93b-5e38-8aea-b130aaa529b6")
	)
	(text "RB-00.5 R6 ADC-input clamp: D n03 / D n04 pin 1 = GND, pin 3 = AIN (ADC side of R n07 / R n08 1.0k), pin 2 = NC.\nNot before the 1k. The 100k DC returns (R n03 / R n04) stay GND-referenced (AIN ~ 0 V DC, inside the ADS131M04 recommended input window for every gain setting; see RB-01R review)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "316776e4-0bd9-5cc8-9c4b-43deb0a51cc9")
	)
	(text "DESIGN INTENT (this sheet):\n- Instanced 4x (CH1..CH4); refs n01..n08, n = channel\n- 10k -> hi-Z (BAV199 / 100pF / 10M->VCM) -> follower -> 2.2uF -> 100k GND -> 1k -> AIN\n- RB-00.5 R6: BAV199 negative clamp on each AIN after the 1k"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 256.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dc7d1f95-97c5-546b-8854-cd5901e5bc20")
	)
